            <div xml:id="d671">

                <pb facs="0572" n="456" xml:id="pg456"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/11988</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Admiral Fletcher to the Secretary of the Navy.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>U. S. S. <hi rendition="#italic">Florida. <lb/> Vera
                            Cruz</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1914-04-12T10:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 12, 1914, 10 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Mayo reports, April 11, 11 a.m.: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Received message from Zaragoza, substance being that he is ordered to
                            await instruction as to action in arrest matter. Have voluntarily
                            informed him that I will not report my failure to obtain promise of
                            reparation until noon April 12. Do not expect compliance with my demands
                            and consider it desirable that Department’s instructions as to further
                            procedure reach me promptly.</p>
                        <p rendition="#right">
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mayo</hi>.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Fletcher</hi></signed>.</closer>


                <xi:include href="d671-a1.xml" xpointer="d671-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
